# Time-warp proof, part 2 of 2: the same rig and the same 440 s of game time under /btswarp 20 (the recorder's warp).
build eyeae
time day

scene warped
  caption Time warp x20 (cheat): the same 440 s of game time.
  goto aeeye+0,-14,-88 look aeeye+0,-6,0
  aecells
  warp 20
  wait game:440 timeout 900
  command /btswarp status
  hold 3
